id: SCA-028
title: Committed git hooks with network calls
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .sh .bash
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: hooks
patterns:
  - regex: (curl|wget|nc\s|ncat\s|python\s+-c|ruby\s+-e|perl\s+-e|base64\s+--?d)
    message: Committed hook script contains network call or encoded payload. Hooks execute on git operations and can run arbitrary code when core.hooksPath is set.
fix: Audit all committed hook scripts. Hooks should only run project-standard tools (linters, formatters). Remove any network calls or encoded payloads.
